OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warn parents of GTA 6
OL,4,Aimpact on children
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents who want to play Grand Theft
OL,7,FAuto 6 are being urged by police in
OL,8,FGuernsey to consider the impact of the
OL,9,Fgame's content on their children.
OL,11,FRockstar's action-adventure game
OL,12,Freleases on Thursday, marking 13 years
OL,13,Fsince the last edition in 2013, which
OL,14,Fwent on to sell nearly 230m copies.
OL,16,FThe game, which allows players to
OL,17,Fexplore vast open worlds, has been
OL,18,Fcontroversial in the past around its
OL,19,Fdepictions of graphic sexual content,
OL,20,Fviolence and drug use.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
