OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warn parents of GTA 6
OL,4,Aimpact on children
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Police said adults who wanted
OL,7,Fto play the game with their children
OL,8,Fshould be careful of being "blinded by
OL,9,Fnostalgia", and should know the new
OL,10,Fgame was "so much bigger and so much
OL,11,Fmore realistic".
